title: "ADHD Classification from Resting-State fMRI: A Multi-Track Study of Dynamic Connectivity, Classical–Quantum Graph Learning, and Cross-Site Generalization"
abstract: "Research code and experimental results evaluating dynamic resting-state functional connectivity, multi-site ComBat harmonization, classical and quantum graph convolutional networks, spatio-temporal baselines, and leave-one-site-out population graph learning across the ADHD-200 dataset."
